{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you receive a text message, telling you of little treats you can earn, only if you complete a few simple tests. Inadvertently you sign away your heart, and things are more deadly than they seemed at first. Using all of the skills at your disposal, earn your freedom and some snacks along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome fast-paced levels testing your limits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Snatcher is a small game about overcoming a series of fast-paced movement-based challenges that require quick reflexes and perhaps retrying a few times. In addition to just dodging tiles, you may have to eliminate projectiles and solve other obstacles that come up over the course of your tests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn treats along the way:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard work and accomplishments aren't for nothing. Earn a variety of little treats throughout your escape and try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965620?t=1759518854","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965620?t=1759518854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/d460665e49f96b228138006c0761d44616714b9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759518854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/d460665e49f96b228138006c0761d44616714b9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759518854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you receive a text message, telling you of little treats you can earn, only if you complete a few simple tests. Inadvertently you sign away your heart, and things are more deadly than they seemed at first. Using all of the skills at your disposal, earn your freedom and some snacks along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome fast-paced levels testing your limits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/43ab178c0d33b916204ab79670cc2e0e.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/db224053de5deb4b32f4cd608c8e1ee9.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Snatcher is a small game about overcoming a series of fast-paced movement-based challenges that require quick reflexes and perhaps retrying a few times. In addition to just dodging tiles, you may have to eliminate projectiles and solve other obstacles that come up over the course of your tests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn treats along the way:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.poster.avif?t=1759518854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.webm?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/extras/9450d0f3c3b2adfc3b0015be67feb554.mp4?t=1759518854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard work and accomplishments aren't for nothing. Earn a variety of little treats throughout your escape and try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BigFridge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965620/58261a6140422a2cff65f54f528a8f777a093b91/header.jpg?t=1759518854","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965620/531471232/cc05e64d1c1027ae24e48b1e76b9c8804639f034/1757435325/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757435991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965620/531471232/cc05e64d1c1027ae24e48b1e76b9c8804639f034/1757435325/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757435991","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965620/531471232/cc05e64d1c1027ae24e48b1e76b9c8804639f034/1757435325/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757435991","id":257195141,"name":"Main Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195141/29540fe0c8f257a26f2d38b196ac0892e1f1ce0e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757435991"}],"name":"Heart Snatcher","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=